     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span lang=\"en\"><span title=\"Al desarrollar la siguiente shinyapps, e intentar subirlo a shinyapps.io se crea una imcompatibilidad con la biblioteca lidR.\r\n\r\n\">When developing the following shinyapps, and attempting to upload it \r\nto <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388252829000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3feEMjieYhPYBjjS4JF25M\">shinyapps.io</a> an imcompatibility is created with the lidR library.<br><br></span><span title=\"Les dejo el codigo:\r\n\r\n\">I leave the code:<br><br></span><span title=\"library(shiny)\r\n\">library (shiny)<br></span><span title=\"#library(lidR)\r\n\">#library (lidR)<br></span><span title=\"library(rgl)\r\n\">library (rgl)<br></span><span title=\"#devtools::install_github(&quot;Jean-Romain/lidR&quot;, dependencies=TRUE, force = TRUE)\r\n\">#devtools :: install_github (&quot;Jean-Romain / lidR&quot;, dependencies = TRUE, force = TRUE)<br></span><span title=\"library(lidR)\r\n\">library (lidR)<br></span><span title=\"library(rglwidget)\r\n\">library (rglwidget)<br></span><span title=\"library(rlas)\r\n\r\n\r\n\">library (rlas)<br><br><br></span><span title=\"options(rgl.useNULL=TRUE)\r\n\r\n\">options (rgl.useNULL = TRUE)<br><br></span><span title=\"ui &lt;- fluidPage(\r\n  \">ui &lt;- fluidPage (<br>  </span><span title=\"fileInput(&quot;File1&quot;, &quot;Carregar o Arquivo CSV&quot;, multiple = TRUE, accept = c(&quot;text/csv&quot;,\r\n  \">fileInput (&quot;File1&quot;, &quot;Carregar or Arquivo CSV&quot;, multiple = TRUE, accept = c (&quot;text / csv&quot;,<br>  </span><span title=\"&quot;text/comma-separated-values,text/plain&quot;,&quot;.csv&quot;)),\r\n  \">&quot;text / comma-separated-values, text / plain&quot;, &quot;. csv&quot;)),<br>  </span><span title=\"rglwidgetOutput(&quot;plot&quot;)\r\n\">rglwidgetOutput (&quot;plot&quot;)<br></span><span title=\")\r\n\r\n\">)<br><br></span><span title=\"server &lt;- function(input, output, session) {\r\n\r\n  \">server &lt;- function (input, output, session) {<br><br>  </span><span title=\"dfiledata &lt;- reactive({\r\n    \">dfiledata &lt;- reactive ({<br>    </span><span title=\"infile &lt;- input$File1\r\n    \">infile &lt;- input $ File1<br>    </span><span title=\"if (is.null(infile)) {\r\n      \">if (is.null (infile)) {<br>      </span><span title=\"# User has not uploaded a file yet\r\n      \"># User has not uploaded a file yet<br>      </span><span title=\"return(NULL)\r\n    \">return (NULL)<br>    </span><span title=\"}\r\n    \">}<br>    </span><span title=\"read.csv(infile$datapath)\r\n  \">read.csv (infile $ datapath)<br>  </span><span title=\"})\r\n\r\n  \">})<br><br>  </span><span title=\"data = reactiveValues(d = NULL)\r\n  \">data = reactiveValues ​​(d = NULL)<br>  </span><span title=\"observe({\r\n    \">I watched({<br>    </span><span title=\"if (is.null(dfiledata())) return()\r\n    \">if (is.null (dfiledata ())) return ()<br>    </span><span title=\"data$d = dfiledata()\r\n    \">data $ d = dfiledata ()<br>    </span><span title=\"str(data$d)\r\n  \">str (data $ d)<br>  </span><span title=\"})\r\n\r\n  \">})<br><br>  </span><span title=\"output$plot = renderRglwidget({\r\n    \">output $ plot = renderRglwidget ({<br>    </span><span title=\"if (is.null(dfiledata())) return()\r\n    \">if (is.null (dfiledata ())) return ()<br>    </span><span title=\"#try(rgl.close())\r\n    \">#try (rgl.close ())<br>    </span><span title=\"#str(data$d)\r\n    \">#str (data $ d)<br>    </span><span title=\"#cols &lt;- brewer.pal(11 , &quot;Spectral&quot; )[data$d$porosity]\r\n    \">#cols &lt;- brewer.pal (11, &quot;Spectral&quot;) [data $ d $ porosity]<br>    </span><span title=\"#cuts = cut(data$d$porosity, breaks = 35)\r\n    \">#cuts = cut (data $ d $ porosity, breaks = 35)<br>    </span><span title=\"plot3d(data$d$x,data$d$y,data$d$z, col = &quot;red&quot;)\r\n    \">plot3d (data $ d $ x, data $ d $ y, data $ d $ z, col = &quot;network&quot;)<br>    </span><span title=\"rglwidget()\r\n  \">rglwidget ()<br>  </span><span title=\"})\r\n\">})<br></span><span title=\"}\r\n\r\n\">}<br><br></span><span title=\"shinyApp(ui, server)\">shinyApp (ui, server)</span></span><div><form action=\"http:///\" name=\"m_3050431860929568921_text_form\" method=\"post\" enctype=\"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" target=\"_blank\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><span>Google Tradutor para empresas:</span><a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?rs=rsmf&amp;q=http://translate.google.com/toolkit%3Fhl%3Dpt-BR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.google.com/url?rs%3Drsmf%26q%3Dhttp://translate.google.com/toolkit%253Fhl%253Dpt-BR&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388252829000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2r7ME7tzUDrBjlzckBHAGy\"><span></span>Google Toolkit de tradução para apps</a><a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?rs=rsmf&amp;q=http://translate.google.com/manager/website/%3Fhl%3Dpt-BR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.google.com/url?rs%3Drsmf%26q%3Dhttp://translate.google.com/manager/website/%253Fhl%253Dpt-BR&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388252829000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Zg4NQuF0jM9q4kH8psEmk\"><span></span>Tradutor de sites</a></div></div> </div></div></div></div></form></div></div>"
